[32m+[m[32mDevelopment Workflow[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis project uses Git to track changes and GitHub to host the repository.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mmain: stable project history[m
[32m+[m[32mdevelop: integration branch for ongoing development[m
[32m+[m[32mfeature/*: branches for individual improvements[m
[32m+[m[32mrelease/*: branches for preparing releases[m
[32m+[m[32mhotfix/*: branches for urgent fixes[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mChanges should be committed with clear messages and reviewed before being[m
[32m+[m[32mmerged into the stable branch.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mVersioning[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mProject releases use semantic versioning:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mMAJOR: incompatible changes[m
[32m+[m[32mMINOR: backward-compatible features[m
[32m+[m[32mPATCH: backward-compatible fixes[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSee CHANGELOG.md for the release history and[m
[32m+[m[32mCourse Map for learning progress.[m
